## The Parlour

@narrator: Six cups, six saucers, five spoons.
@aunt_mabel: The Hollin spoon is gone. My grandmother's spoon!
@vicar: Perhaps it simply wandered off, Mabel.

<branch id="firstLook" prompt="Where do you look first?">
  <choice id="sugarBowl" label="Look in the sugar bowl">
    @pippa: Nothing but lumps.
  </choice>
